" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 19.4.1; Section 19.4.2, first paragraph concerning M_C"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"574–576,578"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"594–596,598"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_C,M_C\">\\(R_C,M_C\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"32e75726563f73a8\" href=\"?note=32e75726563f73a8\" title=\"43-df-nonrandom-complexity-graphs\">43-df-nonrandom-complexity-graphs</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}\">\\(\\operatorname{CE}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"57ebf9aa27784e60\" href=\"?note=57ebf9aa27784e60\" title=\"43-df-tt\">43-df-tt</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}(R_C)\\land\\varnothing&#39;\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}R_C.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CE}(R_C)\\land\\varnothing&#39;\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}R_C.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}(M_C)\\land\\varnothing&#39;\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}M_C.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CE}(M_C)\\land\\varnothing&#39;\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}M_C.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一项为 Kummer 定理。第二项由 σ↦〈#₂(σ),|σ|〉 将 RC 多一归约到 MC，再合成真值表归约得到；因此不要求单独复制长优先构造。真值表完备性强于仅有 Turing 完备性，原文构造使用非一致选择的稳定最大优先级。</p>\n<p>来源：所供 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 19.4.1; Section 19.4.2, first paragraph concerning M_C，印刷页 574–576,578，PDF 页 594–596,598。本轮逐项核对陈述；未把来源完整证明或机器形式化标为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-nonrandom-complexity-graphs","status":"resolved","id":"32e75726563f73a8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-nonrandom-complexity-graphs]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-tt","status":"resolved","id":"57ebf9aa27784e60","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-tt]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nonrandom-complexity-graphs","status":"resolved","id":"32e75726563f73a8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R_C,M_C$ 见 [[43-df-nonrandom-complexity-graphs]]；$\\operatorname{CE}$、$\